<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ ADRs mixed as Dow takes another beating.</title>
<headline>NZ ADRs mixed as Dow takes another beating.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>New Zealand ADRs were mixed in late New York trade against a Dow which was down 62 at 6554 at 7.40 a.m. NZT.</p>
<p>Price movements of NZ stocks listed in the U.S., Britain and Australia.</p>
<p>Company	Exchange    Last	  Net change</p>
<p>Tranz Rail     N.Y.    US$18	     -0 1/4 *</p>
<p>FCL Bldg	 N.Y.    US$29 1/2	 +0 1/2 *</p>
<p>FCL Engy	 N.Y.    US$27 3/4	 +0 3/4 *</p>
<p>FCL Paper	N.Y.    US$19 1/2	 -0 1/4 *</p>
<p>FCL Forest     N.Y.    US$12 7/8	 +0 1/8 *</p>
<p>Telecom	  N.Y.    US$72 1/4	 nil    *</p>
<p>Thistle	  London  184		 nil</p>
<p>Guinness Peat  London  36		  nil</p>
<p>NZ IT	    London  238		 nil</p>
<p>Foreign &amp; Col  London  150		 -1 1/2</p>
<p>Templeton	London  142		 -1</p>
<p>Lion	     Sydney  A$3.07	    +0.02</p>
<p>Goodman	  Sydney  A$1.64	    +0.01</p>
<p>Macraes	  Sydney  A$2.34	    +0.04</p>
<p>Notes - In New York, Telecom's American Depository Receipts are traded in bundles of eight shares, while both the Fletcher Challenge shares are in bundles of 10 each. Tranz Rail ADSs are groups of three ordinary shares.</p>
<p>- London prices are mid-rates.</p>
<p>* Denotes still trading.</p>
<p>-- Wellington Newsroom 64 4 4734 746</p>
</text>
